{"id":"3de4d546216326d8","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md","title":"Sheaf Cohomology","display":"df-sheaf-cohomology — Sheaf Cohomology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sheaf-cohomology","aliases":["58-df-sheaf-cohomology"],"display":"df-sheaf-cohomology — Sheaf Cohomology","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sheaf-cohomology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sheaf-cohomology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sheaf-cohomology — Sheaf Cohomology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2cb2118f43b23b3\" href=\"?note=b2cb2118f43b23b3\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md\">../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8876d83b2589a917\" href=\"?note=8876d83b2589a917\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md\">../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8fff134618bbd5c\" href=\"?note=d8fff134618bbd5c\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md\">../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cbc1735835617989\" href=\"?note=cbc1735835617989\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md\">../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,i,X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X\\in V\">\\(H,i,X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S\\)</span> 使用内部依赖定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 已由阿贝尔范畴和范畴分解文件完全定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SheavesOfAbelianGroups}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{SheavesOfAbelianGroups}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GlobalSectionsFunctor}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{GlobalSectionsFunctor}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 按下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ab}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ab}\\)</span> 仍是原接口显式提供的值范畴，不默认为某个未给出的真类范畴。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> 是原有八元谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d8fff134618bbd5c\" href=\"?note=d8fff134618bbd5c\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md\">../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaves\\text{-}of\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}groups}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SheavesOfAbelianGroups}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal S,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists O\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nO=\\{F\\in\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S(\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathsf{Ab}):\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(F,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal S,O,\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaves\\text{-}of\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}groups}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SheavesOfAbelianGroups}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal S,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists O\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nO=\\{F\\in\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S(\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathsf{Ab}):\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(F,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal S,O,\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}sections\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GlobalSectionsFunctor}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Gamma,X,\\tau,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SheavesOfAbelianGroups}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal S,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\mathcal S,\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}sections\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GlobalSectionsFunctor}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Gamma,X,\\tau,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SheavesOfAbelianGroups}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal S,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\mathcal S,\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}cohomology} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S(H,i,X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathsf{Ab})\\land\n\\mathrm{SheavesOfAbelianGroups}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\land\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\land i\\in\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{GlobalSectionsFunctor}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Gamma_X,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab})\\land\n\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(H,\\Gamma_X,\\mathcal F,i,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}cohomology} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S(H,i,X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathsf{Ab})\\land\n\\mathrm{SheavesOfAbelianGroups}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\land\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{Ab})\\land i\\in\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{GlobalSectionsFunctor}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Gamma_X,X,\\tau,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab})\\land\n\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(H,\\Gamma_X,\\mathcal F,i,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原有拓扑、值范畴、层范畴和全局截面函子四项相对数据保持显式；没有把八元接口改成四元接口。</li>\n<li>右导出值使用同一层范畴中的内射分解和同一全局截面函子；输出按目标范畴同构确定。</li>\n<li>命名中保留的 meta 现在均有前两节中的精确定义，不再表示需要读者补充的外部数学约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2cb2118f43b23b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md","status":"resolved","id":"8876d83b2589a917","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location